            <ArticleTitle>[Scrotal and perineal pain following coitus interruptus].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>408</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of perineal-scrotal and hypogastric pain following coitus interruptus in a young male patient is described. The physiopathological mechanisms involved in this condition in normal subjects or those with neuropathic disorders are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
